==Russian==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/stʊpˈnʲæ/|lang=ru}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun|ступня́|f-in}}

# {{context|anatomy|lang=ru}} [[foot]]
# [[sole]]

====Usage notes====
Russian usually does not distinguish between "leg" and "foot", using '''[[нога]]''' for both. Use '''ступня''' only when it is vital to make the distinction, as in medical situations.

